{"doc_name": "Ghosts__What_We_Do_in_the_Shadows", "chunk_id": 0, "question": "What did Katie Rife of The A.V. Club say about the episode \"Ghosts\"?", "answer": "\"A pretty good episode of What We Do In The Shadows is still better than the best episode of many TV comedies, however. And it's exciting to see that the show is getting a little more ambitious in its action scenes and with its special effects while keeping all the things that made the first season click. There were some fabulous faux-medieval paintings of Nandor in this episode as well. Shoutout to the art history nerd who creates those.\"", "method": "synthetic_qa", "stats": {"prompt_length_toks": 1368, "prompt_length_chars": 6095, "completion_length_toks": 1287, "completion_length_chars": 5407}}
